    },
    {
      "id": "formula_ex5_s_step3",
      "latex": "\\Delta = (-6)^2 - 4(4)(1) = 36 - 16 = 20 \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{6 \\pm \\sqrt{20}}{8} = \\frac{6 \\pm 2\\sqrt{5}}{8} = \\frac{3 \\pm \\sqrt{5}}{4}",
